  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Kumasi&apos;s Capacity to Build Public-Private Partnerships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Planning and program design of a city-to-city partnership between Atlanta, Georgia and Kumasi, Ghana.  The objectives of the project are to strengthen the capacity of the City of Kumasi to manage the delivery of public-private services and infrastructure, and attract investments and trade needed to support Kumasi&apos;s long-term development.</narrative>
  </description>
